  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"industries.html\">Industries</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Technology</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Industry</p>\n        <h1>Press release distribution for technology companies</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Reach 11,400+ desks, trade titles and aggregators that actually cover technology. Every release is reviewed by an editor who reads this sector daily, then formatted so search and AI systems can quote it.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"submit.html?industry=technology\">Submit a technology release</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"pricing.html\">See pricing</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:1.5rem\" data-reveal=\"right\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Sector snapshot</p>\n        <p class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-2)\">11,400+</p>\n        <p class=\"stat-label\">relevant desks &amp; outlets</p>\n        <div class=\"chip-row mt-3\"><span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">developer tools</span><span class=\"tag\">cloud</span><span class=\"tag\">cybersecurity</span><span class=\"tag\">semiconductors</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  PressCosmos distributes technology press releases to 11,400+ relevant outlets, covering product launches, funding rounds and platform announcements. Every release gets specialist editorial review, industry keyword guidance and AI answer-engine formatting as standard. Per-release pricing starts at $149.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Angles</p>\n      <h2>What actually gets picked up in technology</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Most releases in this sector fail for the same reason: they describe the organisation instead of the news. These are the angles that travel.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\" data-stagger>\n      <article class=\"card spotlight\">\n        <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Product and platform launches</h3><p>Feature releases, GA dates, architecture changes and developer tooling.</p>\n      </article><article class=\"card spotlight\">\n        <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Funding and M&A</h3><p>Rounds, acquisitions and strategic partnerships, with the numbers a tech desk expects.</p>\n      </article><article class=\"card spotlight\">\n        <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Research and benchmarks</h3><p>Original data, model evaluations and performance studies that reporters can cite.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Coverage</p>\n      <h2>Release types we handle</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"split\">\n      <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:1.6rem\" data-reveal>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Common technology releases</p>\n        <ul class=\"list-check\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Product launches</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Funding rounds</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Open-source releases</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Security advisories</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Developer conferences</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Research papers</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Executive hires</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Acquisition announcements</span></li></ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack prose\" style=\"--flow:1rem\" data-reveal=\"right\">\n        <h3 class=\"mt-0\">How this route is built</h3>\n        <p>Our technology route combines national and international newswires with sector trade press, regional desks in the metros that matter to you, and the AI answer engines that handle industry questions. You choose the tier; we handle the routing.</p>\n        <p>Reviews are handled by editors who work this beat, which matters most when a claim needs qualifying or a number needs a source.</p>\n        <p><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"distribution.html\">How distribution routing works <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"panel panel-glass\" style=\"padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.25rem);border-radius:var(--r-xl)\" data-reveal>\n      \n<div class=\"callout callout-takeaways\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Key takeaways</strong>\n  <ul><li>Median first pickup for technology releases: 38 minutes on priority plans.</li><li>11,400+ sector-relevant outlets, plus AI answer engines on every plan.</li><li>Specialist editorial review — not a generic queue.</li><li>Metro and country-level targeting included at no extra cost.</li></ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"split\" style=\"align-items:start\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\" data-reveal>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Answers</p>\n        <h2>Technology distribution questions</h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"mt-3 muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Still stuck? <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Talk to a specialist <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-list\" data-accordion=\"single\">\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">How do I announce a product launch without it reading like an ad?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Lead with what changed and for whom, in the first sentence. Include a specific number — adoption, speed, price or capacity. Our editor will push back on anything that opens with \"excited to announce\".</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Do you distribute developer-focused announcements?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes, including open-source releases, SDK updates and security advisories. Security advisories can be routed on an accelerated lane when coordinated disclosure timing matters.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Can you handle embargoes for a launch?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes. Set the embargo to an exact minute and timezone, and the release holds across every lane until that moment.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">What about a funding round with disclosure restrictions?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">We support approved language, staged reveals and jurisdiction-specific variants. Send us the constraints and the editor will build the release within them.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Related industries</p>\n      <h2>Other sectors we cover</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\"><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"saas.html\" data-reveal><h3>SaaS & B2B Software</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">3,900+ B2B review sites and analyst blogs in network</p></a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"finance.html\" data-reveal><h3>Finance & Banking</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Terminal and analyst-desk delivery across 41 markets</p></a><a class=\"card spotlight\" href=\"crypto-web3.html\" data-reveal><h3>Crypto & Web3</h3><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">480+ crypto-native outlets and market-data feeds</p></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Send your next technology announcement to the desks that cover it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">Editorial review, sector targeting, monitoring and AI visibility reporting included.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a press release</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"pricing.html\">See pricing</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
